        "original_id": "89d8a591-e010-5905-9bdc-2277c91310b0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kevin Rowland, Lauri Ylönen\n- Bands: Dexys Midnight Runners, Dexys, The Rasmus\n- Products: My Beauty, \"Geno\", \"Come On Eileen\"\n- Roles: singer-songwriter, frontman\n\nFacts:\n- Kevin Rowland was born on 17 August 1953 and is an English-born singer-songwriter of Irish descent.\n- Kevin Rowland was the frontman of the pop band Dexys Midnight Runners, which is currently called Dexys.\n- Dexys Midnight Runners had several hits in the early 1980s, including \"Geno\" and \"Come On Eileen,\" and both songs reached number one on the U.K. singles chart.\n- Lauri Ylönen was born on 23 April 1979 and is a Finnish singer-songwriter.\n- Lauri Ylönen is best known as the frontman of the Finnish alternative rock band The Rasmus.\n- My Beauty is a solo album by Kevin Rowland, the lead singer of Dexys Midnight Runners.",
